Status

pvAccess defines a structure to inform endpoints about completion status. It is nominally defined as:

struct Status {

byte type; // enum { OK = 0, WARNING = 1, ERROR = 2, FATAL = 3 } string message; string callTree; // optional (provides more context data about the error), can be␣

